      <Quiz id="quiz-stack" questions={quiz} />
      <div class="remember">
        <p class="note-label">Key takeaways</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Stack: last in, first out. <code>push</code>, <code>pop</code>, and <code>peek</code> all happen at the top.</li>
          <li><code>pop</code> removes and returns the top item; <code>peek</code> only looks.</li>
          <li>In <code>ArrayStack</code>, <code>top</code> is the index of the top item: -1 means empty, and the size is <code>top + 1</code>.</li>
          <li><code>push</code> moves <code>top</code> up, then stores. <code>pop</code> leaves the old value in its cell, above <code>top</code>.</li>
          <li>Guard against underflow (empty) and overflow (full) before acting.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
